        }
      ],
      "text_preview": "It is further contention of learned counsel that the accident did not occur due to triple riding of the motorcycle without wearing of helmets and infact, it may be violation of law, but such violation by itself cannot lead to a finding of c"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "43eca372840a4bbc81125e7b1fa5c86f_36",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7. Having heard learned counsel for the parties and on perusal of the material on record, it is seen that FIR NC: 2024:KHC:16244 has been registered against driver of the offending vehicle i.e, Bolero for the offences punishable under Secti"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4860b9e39eff4fb38594ccc89e73afa3_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The occurrence of accident, involvement of vehicle, injuries sustained by the claimant and the accident occurred due to negligence of driver of the offending vehicle are established by the evidence adduced and the documents produced as per "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "347444bede9b474198ff5d94192a6931_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nTherefore, the tribunal rightly attributed the negligence against driver of the Bolero vehicle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da8297c83f184b62a3eeee2071694fb1_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n8. Now coming to the question of age, avocation, income and disability suffered by the claimant, it is seen that the claimant was aged 33 years as on the date of accident and the appropriate multiplier would be '16', which is rightly appli"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c0ca0bc42da3415882f32d5aba7f305e_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Though the claimant pleaded that he was working as a weaver earning Rs.15,000/- per month, no material is placed before the Court with regard to the same and proof of income."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "94478cdb3f394fbb88c2c26b5b89a120_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In the absence of the NC: 2024:KHC:16244 same, the Tribunal has taken the income of the claimant to be Rs.7,000/-\nper month, whereas the Legal Services Authority chart prescribes the notional income of Rs.9,500/-\nper month for the accident "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b974cf1e411a4f7590e4a8bfd28b4492_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Accordingly, the same is taken as income for computation in the present case as against Rs.7,000/- taken by the Tribunal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "883f5bb05c5243dca432155869a4635d_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9. The doctor has been examined as PW.2."
