      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. In view of the above, loss of future earnings would be Rs.5,36,256/- {[Rs.9,500 + 3800 (40%)] x 12 - 11 - NC: 2024:KHC:16244 x 16 x 21%} as against Rs.2,41,920/- awarded by the Tribunal."
